{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106683","id":2534777305,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6XFaHZ","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106683","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106683.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106683.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106683","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106683/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106683/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106683/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/7aafa6ef181c29d16dc3252cddff880964cb538b","number":106683,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"GDScript: Remove `leftmost_column` and `rightmost_column` fields","user":{"login":"dalexeev","id":47700418,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzAwNDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47700418?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev","html_url":"https://github.com/dalexeev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"```\r\n                   v start_column\r\n 1 | var string := \"test     | < start_line\r\n 2 |     test test test test |\r\n 3 |     test\"               | < end_line\r\n             ^ end_column\r\n     ^ leftmost_column\r\n          rightmost_column ^\r\n\r\n                   v start_column, leftmost_column\r\n 1 | var string := \"test\" | < start_line, end_line\r\n                        ^ end_column, rightmost_column\r\n```\r\n\r\nI think these fields are pretty useless and are really only used in one place (`test_tokenizer()`).\r\n\r\nBefore:\r\n\r\n```\r\n0002     print(\"test test\r\n0003 test test test test test\r\n0004 test test test\")\r\n     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\r\n --> Literal(String) test test\r\ntest test test test test\r\ntest test test\r\n```\r\n\r\nAfter:\r\n\r\n```\r\n               vvvvvvvvvv\r\n0002     print(\"test test\r\n0003 test test test test test\r\n0004 test test test\")\r\n     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\r\n --> Literal(String) test test\r\ntest test test test test\r\ntest test test\r\n```\r\n\r\nGDScript does not have a syntax where the boundary columns of multi-line tokens are important for parsing or error messages. Such information might be needed in markup languages ​​with ASCII tables (Markdown, reStructuredText), but probably not in scripting languages ​​with simple syntax.\r\n\r\nInstead, we could add `start_position` and `end_position` fields to be able to use `substr()` to get the source code of a token or a range of tokens. See https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106198#discussion_r2098322864.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2304948121,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMzA0OTQ4MTIx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:codestyle","name":"topic:codestyle","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","number":22,"state":"closed","title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z"},"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-05-21T15:30:44Z","updated_at":"2025-06-05T15:57:27Z","closed_at":"2025-06-05T11:19:19Z","merged_at":"2025-06-05T11:19:19Z","merge_commit_sha":"0518bd5feebe7e8211959a5bf2aef0ac5a322b05","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams"